# Scratch. tmp/ already held two ad-hoc message drafts from August and a
# one-off icon preview; none of it belongs in the repo, and leaving it
# untracked meant `git status` listed noise beside real uncommitted work —
# which is how five finished guide pages sat unnoticed for a week.
tmp/
.commit-msg-tmp
